<title>FRANCE: Soccer-French league summary.</title>
<headline>Soccer-French league summary.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of French first division match on Thursday:</p>
<p>Bordeaux 3 (Stephane Ziani 16, Claudio Biaggio 45, Jean-Pierre Papin 52) Montpellier 1 (Franck Sauzee 65). Halftime: 2-0. Attendance: 12,000</p>
